### ---------- Week 9 in class: dirty checking and error bodies (rooms) ----------

### 26. Same values again (expect 200; console: one select, no update)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Study Pod", "capacity": 4 }

### 27. New values (expect 200; console: select, then update)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Study Pod XL", "capacity": 6 }

### 28. Blank name (expect 400, fieldErrors: name)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "capacity": 5 }

### 29. Capacity 0 (expect 400, fieldErrors: capacity)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Closet", "capacity": 0 }

### 30. Two bad fields (expect 400, two fieldErrors)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "capacity": 50 }

### 31. Missing room (expect 404, message "room 99 not found")
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99

### 32. Room with reservations (expect 409, message "room 1 has reservations")
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1

### 33. A URL that does not exist (expect 404, not 500)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/nothing

### ---------- Week 9 Lab E: reservations and bad input ----------

### 34. Blank reservedBy (expect 400, fieldErrors: reservedBy)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "", "startTime": "2026-11-02T10:00:00", "endTime": "2026-11-02T11:00:00" }

### 35. Missing endTime (expect 400, fieldErrors: endTime)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "Lee", "startTime": "2026-11-02T10:00:00" }

### 36. End before start (expect 400, message "startTime must be before endTime")
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "Lee", "startTime": "2026-11-02T12:00:00", "endTime": "2026-11-02T11:00:00" }

### 37. Overlaps Mina (expect 409, message "room 1 is already booked at that time")
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "Lee", "startTime": "2026-10-06T10:30:00", "endTime": "2026-10-06T11:30:00" }

### 38. Missing reservation (expect 404, message "reservation 99 not found")
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/99

### 39. Missing query parameter (expect 400)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations

### 40. Not a number (expect 400, "request body is missing or is not valid JSON")
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Lab", "capacity": "ten" }

### 41. Not an id (expect 400, "'id' has the wrong type")
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/abc
